{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026XhyZMpdAoB1794789860.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>外圍美股下挫，聯儲局官員偏鷹，美國零售降溫，港股料低開逾200點；市場關注輝達及騰訊業績。</p><h2><strong>港股開市受壓</strong></h2><p>港股料低開逾200點。美股方面，道指跌848點，標普500指數跌至逾三個月低，納指跌0.7%，見半年低。</p><h2><strong>聯儲局官員：或須再加息</strong></h2><p>穆薩萊姆表示，春季前或須加息數次；威廉斯稱或須再加息，但不須激進。美國零售降溫。</p><h2><strong>輝達業績及股價</strong></h2><p>輝達上季收入倍增，並提高指引。黃仁勳稱願重掌輝達，董事會主席表示不考慮。股價走勢圖顯示，最高位243.37美元，近日低位148.8美元，資料來源彭博。</p><h2><strong>其他消息</strong></h2><p>Anthropic新股據報以指引區間上限定價。騰訊業績。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T01:43:44.143289+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":276,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T00:40:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T17:57:35.812936+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T01:36:53.802483+00:00","content_hash":"8018b53dd45602176a0a3fd66c2ef2ccb621ebf3f0be1ece454020c4253fcab6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T01:43:44.143289+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}